Enter a calm, focused stance, increasing physical power and accuracy by [19, 24, 29, 32, 35 (TL1-5; DEX 100)], projectile speed by [45%, 71%, 87%, 98%, 106% (TL1-5)] and the chance to mark targets by an additional [2%, 4%, 6%, 8%, 10% (TL1-5)].

This makes your shots more effective at range, increasing all damage dealt by [1.7%, 2.6%, 3.2%, 3.7%, 4.1% (TL1-5)] per tile travelled beyond 3, to a maximum of [8.3%, 13%, 16%, 18%, 20% (TL1-5)] damage at range 8.

The physical power and accuracy increase with your Dexterity. This requires a bow to use.
